   "title": "顶栏叶子菜单误同步侧栏并混入常量路由",
   "type": "preference",
   "content": "根因为顶栏叶子菜单点击后`TagsView`仍调用`resolveSidebarRoutes`写回`SET_SIDEBAR_ROUTERS`，且`childrenMenus`混入`constantRoutes`致侧栏错显。修复点在`ruoyi.js`增加`shouldSyncSidebarForTopNav`使仅顶栏目录项同步侧栏，`TagsView`与`Navbar`统一用`collectNavbarChildrenMenus`构建子菜单剔除`constantRoutes`。",
